# Run convex dev to select an isolated example deployment.
# Set SITE_URL, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET, and AUTH_EMAIL_DELIVERY with `convex env set`.
# Controlled browser tests use AUTH_EMAIL_DELIVERY=controlled and MAILBOX_URL.
# Explicit live-email qualification uses AUTH_EMAIL_DELIVERY=resend, AUTH_EMAIL_FROM,
# RESEND_API_KEY, and RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET.
